  explain:{ q:'The champion used loops for long legs and single blocks for corners. What\'s that called?', o:[
      'Cheating','Matching the tool to the pattern — efficiency thinking','Random luck'], a:1,
    why:'Repeated pattern → loop. One-off corner → single block. Choosing the right structure for each shape IS the engineering.' },
  hints:['Symmetric legs are loop heaven. Corners are single blocks.'],
